00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:58.100
Most of those scenarios actually lead to the
speaker of the House becoming president.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:02.210
It's important to understand it doesn't mean
there is not some hypothetical scenario that

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:05.820
