remain in the White House.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:08.129
I don't worry about voting right now.

00:02:08.129 --> 00:02:09.129
OK.

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:10.129
That's the important thing.

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:11.640
We've got three and a half months until November.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:16.390
Let's win first, then we'll have two more
two and a half more months to make sure Donald

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.290
Trump vacates the White House.

